§ `Tests -- s 907 Approval of members of merging companies`
-- (more than half in number, and at least 75% in value, of each class present and voting)
#ASSERT `s 907(1) the scheme has been approved by the members of the merging company` (JUST FALSE) (LIST (`s 907(1) votes of a class of members` OF 100, 51, 1000, 750), (`s 907(1) votes of a class of members` OF 10, 6, 100, 80)) EQUALS `s 903(1) requirement complied with`
#ASSERT `s 907(1) the scheme has been approved by the members of the merging company` (JUST FALSE) (LIST (`s 907(1) votes of a class of members` OF 100, 51, 1000, 750), (`s 907(1) votes of a class of members` OF 10, 5, 100, 80)) EQUALS `s 903(1) requirement not complied with`
#ASSERT `s 907(1) the scheme has been approved by the members of the merging company` (JUST FALSE) (LIST (`s 907(1) votes of a class of members` OF 100, 51, 1000, 749)) EQUALS `s 903(1) requirement not complied with`
#ASSERT `s 907(1) the scheme has been approved by the members of the merging company` (JUST TRUE) (LIST (`s 907(1) votes of a class of members` OF 100, 10, 1000, 1)) EQUALS `s 903(1) requirement does not apply`
#ASSERT `s 907(1) the scheme has been approved by the members of the merging company` NOTHING (LIST (`s 907(1) votes of a class of members` OF 100, 90, 1000, 900)) EQUALS `s 903(1) requirement not covered`
#ASSERT `s 907(2) the meeting of members is not required` (JUST FALSE) (JUST FALSE) (JUST FALSE) (JUST TRUE) EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 907(2) the meeting of members is not required` (JUST FALSE) (JUST FALSE) (JUST FALSE) (JUST FALSE) EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `s 907(2) the meeting of members is not required` (JUST FALSE) NOTHING (JUST FALSE) (JUST FALSE) EQUALS NOTHING

