§ `Tests -- s 910 Supplementary accounting statement (merger)`
-- s 910(1)(a): the last accounts' financial year ended before the date seven months before the first meeting (meeting 15 October 2026: 15 March 2026; ending on 14 March is before, on 15 March is not)
#ASSERT `s 910(1) this section applies` (Date 14 3 2026) (JUST (Date 15 10 2026)) (Date 1 9 2026) EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 910(1) this section applies` (Date 15 3 2026) (JUST (Date 15 10 2026)) (Date 1 9 2026) EQUALS JUST FALSE
-- s 910(1)(b): no meeting required: before the date six months before the directors adopt the draft terms (adopted 1 September 2026: 1 March 2026)
#ASSERT `s 910(1) this section applies` (Date 28 2 2026) NOTHING (Date 1 9 2026) EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 910(1) this section applies` (Date 1 3 2026) NOTHING (Date 1 9 2026) EQUALS JUST FALSE
