#ASSERT `s 910(1A) the directors have prepared a supplementary accounting statement` NOTHING (JUST FALSE) FALSE FALSE EQUALS `s 903(1) requirement not covered`
#ASSERT `s 910(1A) the directors have prepared a supplementary accounting statement` (JUST TRUE) (JUST TRUE) FALSE FALSE EQUALS `s 903(1) requirement does not apply`
-- s 910(2)(a): a balance sheet as at a date not more than three months before the draft terms were adopted (adopted 1 September 2026: 1 June 2026 is exactly three months)
